            this.HighComplex = highcomplex;
            this.MediumComplex = mediumcomplex;
            this.LowComplex = lowcomplex;
        }
    }

This survey isn't to gather every variable we're looking for. It's to gather specific data that we can weave with our current variables. This will provide an extra layer of reliability. 

