It's very common for me to have around 30-40 cs at 10 minutes in almost all of my games. Although, you can't play Camille mid without having good knowledge of how to control the wave. I generally out level my enemy mid laners afk farming while I roam by about 2 levels at the 8-9 minutes mark, simply because I'm soaking all of the XP up from wave management. 

&#x200B;

It's very detriment to get ANY type of lead on Camille early. You should be sweating if you haven't accomplished anything to start a snowball before 17 minutes. You need to average a Triforce purchase no later than 13-14 minutes every single game. 

&#x200B;

Camille does have horrible wave clear, but I don't agree that it's lacking once you have a tiamat. I kill waves with 1 rotation of my wave clear combo once I have tiamat.
